---
description: Tentmaker ground rules. Applies to every change in this repo.
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before any change. It is the only source of rules, and
nested `AGENTS.md` files add area rules.

Before anything else in a task:

1. Run `git remote -v` and confirm it shows `github.com:jameymcelveen/tentmaker`. Stop if not.
2. Read the spec in `docs/specs/` for the slice you were asked to build. No spec, no code.
3. Work on a branch named `slice/NNN-short-name`. Never commit to `main`. Never push
   without asking.

Plain ASCII only in everything you write. Run `python3 scripts/check_ascii.py` before you
say you are done.
